        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼女は春らしい明るい色のワンピースを着ていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "壁紙を明るいトーンに変更したら、部屋全体が広く見えるようになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "暗い夜道でも目立つように、なるべく明るい色の上着を着て出かける。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "cheerful",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼はいつも明るい笑顔で挨拶してくれるので、こちらも元気をもらえる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "職場の雰囲気が明るいおかげで、毎日楽しく仕事ができている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "何があっても前向きで明るい彼女の性格に、何度も救われてきた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "bright (future, prospects, etc.)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "若者たちが活躍できるような、明るい未来を築いていきたい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "新規事業の売上が好調で、我が社の将来は明るいと言えるだろう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "困難な状況ではあるが、決して見通しが明るくないわけではない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "gloss": "knowledgeable (about)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼はこの地域の歴史にとても明るいので、案内をお願いした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "機械に明るいスタッフがすぐにパソコンの不具合を直してくれた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "私は税金関係の法律に明るくないので、専門家に相談するつもりだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
